"Upon receiving a SERVICE ACCEPT message for cases other than h) in subclause 5.6.1.1, the UE shall:
- stop timer T3517;
- enter 5GMM-SERVICE-ACCEPTED;
- if the UE has uplink CIoT user data or SMS to be sent, the UE may initiate the service request procedure as specified in subclause 5.6.1.2;
- if the UE has pending uplink user data for PDU session(s) with user-plane resources already established, the UE may initiate the service request procedure as specified in subclause 5.6.1.2;
- if the UE has a pending registration procedure, proceed with the pending procedure;"
